# .gitignore — publishing/src/
#
# Template-owned; copier update keeps it current. Project-wide rules belong in the root .gitignore.
# No inline comments in this file: Git reads a # after a pattern as part of the pattern.

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Rendered deliverables, burned versions and thumbnail PNGs
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Made by the toolkit from the master, the captions and the thumbnail layouts on request:
# regenerable, and too large for plain Git. The folder's README stays tracked, so the folder
# and its explanation exist in every checkout. Never force a render past this rule.
/renders/*
!/renders/README.md
